signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-18T05:58:59-07:00","id":1540615,"title":"","content":"It's possible for someone to have a different tribe as ancestors--uncommon, but not unheard of. If the Bone Gnawers can't connect with their own ancestors it's unlikely someone outside the tribe could, though. Still, restricted backgrounds <i>can</i> be purchased if the ST approves it, and W20 doesn't give us a clear idea on why Ancestors is banned for Bone Gnawers. Perhaps your group will simply decide to ignore that rule.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28383-citrakayah","name":"Citrakayah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28383_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-18T09:36:03-07:00","id":1540634,"title":"","content":"I just realized it would at least be twice the price, maybe thrice, because it's restricted to Bone Gnawers. Either way, I guess I can't do that...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-18T18:30:26-07:00","id":1540676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolf-Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1540198-some-guidance-with-picking-my-character-s-spirit-heritage?p=1540634#post1540634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just realized it would at least be twice the price, maybe thrice, because it's restricted to Bone Gnawers. Either way, I guess I can't do that...</div> </div> </div> </div>This rule is not in the rulebook, so no it wouldn't unless your DM said that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28383-citrakayah","name":"Citrakayah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28383_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}